Package: lutefisk
Type: Package
Title: Functional and Phylogenetic Ecology in R
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-09-19
Authors@R: person("Nathan G.", "Swenson", email = "swenson228@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions, example datasets and worked analyses accompanying the
    second edition of "Functional and Phylogenetic Ecology in R" (Springer,
    Use R! series). The package is the successor to 'lefse' 0.5. It provides
    hand-built, base-R implementations of the phylogenetic and functional
    alpha and beta diversity metrics, null models, comparative methods and
    lineage representation tests developed in the book, written so that the
    arithmetic behind each metric is visible and, wherever the mathematics
    allows, vectorized with matrix algebra rather than loops.
